{% comment %}
  Blog posts — 首页选购指南引流（task-index T-2.5，pages-ui §2）。
  文章块 ×3：左图右文行卡 + 标题 + 摘要 + 阅读更多。

  2026-11-12 刘工：图位改为**恒定存在**。原实现只在 article.image 非空时输出
  media，演示店多数博文没配图 ⇒ 三张卡里两三张是纯文字灰卡，看起来完全不像图文卡。
  现在缺图一律用 icon-leaf.svg 占位，口径照抄 sections/search.liquid 的博文默认图
  （品牌淡底 + 55% 品牌色绿叶），整块与搜索页行卡是同一套视觉语言。
  卡片 hover 走全站签名 --card-hover-shadow / --card-hover-lift，配色全部从
  --color-* 派生（原 rgb(0 0 0 / x) 硬编码在 Noir 深底上摘要几乎不可读）。
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign blog_source = section.settings.blog
  assign limit = section.settings.posts_to_show | default: 3
-%}

{%- if blog_source != blank and blog_source.articles.size > 0 -%}
  <div class="blog-posts">
    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
      <h2 class="blog-posts__heading" data-reveal>{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
      <p class="blog-posts__subheading" data-reveal>{{ section.settings.subheading | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    <ul class="blog-posts__grid" role="list">
      {%- for article in blog_source.articles limit: limit -%}
        <li
          class="blog-posts__item"
          data-reveal
          style="--reveal-delay: {{ forloop.index0 | times: 80 }}ms"
        >
          <a class="blog-posts__card" href="{{ article.url }}">
            <span class="blog-posts__media">
              {%- if article.image != blank -%}
                {{
                  article.image
                  | image_url: width: 600
                  | image_tag:
                    widths: '300, 600',
                    sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 14vw, 36vw',
                    loading: 'lazy',
                    alt: article.image.alt
                }}
              {%- else -%}
                <span class="blog-posts__media-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
                  {{- 'icon-leaf.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
            <span class="blog-posts__body">
              <h3 class="blog-posts__title">{{ article.title | escape }}</h3>
              {%- comment -%}
                按词截断（与 search.liquid 的 24 词同口径），不按字符 truncate: 90 ——
                字符截断会把 "matter" 切成 "matt..."，2 行 clamp 后特别扎眼。
                视觉上最终由 CSS 的 2 行 clamp 收口，这里只限制 DOM 文本长度。
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- if article.excerpt != blank -%}
                <p class="blog-posts__excerpt">{{ article.excerpt | strip_html | truncatewords: 24 }}</p>
              {%- elsif article.content != blank -%}
                <p class="blog-posts__excerpt">{{ article.content | strip_html | truncatewords: 24 }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="blog-posts__read-more">{{ 'sections.blog_posts.read_more' | t }}</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .blog-posts__heading {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-block-end: 0.75rem;
  }
  .blog-posts__grid {
    display: grid;
    /* minmax(0, 1fr) 从源头掐断 min-content 传导，裸 1fr 会被长标题撑出视口 */
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .blog-posts__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  .blog-posts__item {
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }
  /* 左图右文：固定图列 + 可收缩文字列。与 search.liquid 的行卡同构，
     只是首页图位放大到 120px（卡本身更宽）。 */
  .blog-posts__card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.9rem;
    height: 100%;
    min-block-size: 8.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 10%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    /* 用 translate 而非 transform：滚动入场的 animation 用 transform，
       两套机制互不抢占（见 critical.css 的 reveal-in 注释）。 */
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, translate 0.2s ease;
  }
  .blog-posts__card:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 40%, transparent);
    box-shadow: var(--card-hover-shadow);
    translate: 0 var(--card-hover-lift);
  }
  .blog-posts__card:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-brand);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .blog-posts__media {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    min-inline-size: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 8%, transparent);
  }
  /* 图脱离文档流：width:100% 的流内 img 会按固有宽高比参与 grid 行高，
     摘要长度不同的卡会被拉得忽高忽矮（use-case-grid 7:3→5:5 的教训）。
     显式 height:100% 也压掉 image_tag 输出的 HTML height presentational hint。 */
  .blog-posts__media img,
  .blog-posts__media-placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .blog-posts__media img {
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .blog-posts__media-placeholder {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-brand) 55%, transparent);
  }
  .blog-posts__media-placeholder svg {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
  }
  .blog-posts__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }
  .blog-posts__title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
    /* break-word 只在单词超宽时才断，anywhere 会拆断 Chainsaws 这类词 */
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }
  .blog-posts__excerpt {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }
  .blog-posts__read-more {
    margin-block-start: auto;
    padding-block-start: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-brand-accent);
  }
  .blog-posts__read-more::after {
    content: '\2192';
    margin-inline-start: 0.3rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .blog-posts__card {
      grid-template-columns: 5.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .blog-posts__media-placeholder svg {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .blog-posts__card {
      transition: none;
    }
    .blog-posts__card:hover {
      translate: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.blog_posts.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "blog-posts-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "blog",
      "id": "blog",
      "label": "t:labels.blog"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:labels.heading",
      "default": "t:sections.blog_posts.defaults.heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "t:labels.subheading",
      "default": "t:sections.blog_posts.defaults.subheading"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "posts_to_show",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 4,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "t:labels.posts_to_show",
      "default": 3
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:sections.blog_posts.name"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
